---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { INDEPENDENCE } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Funding & Affiliate Disclosure" description="HomeGeneratorGuide funding disclosure: no live affiliate links or advertising, no generator-brand payments, and no dealer or installer referral fees.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Funding & Affiliate Disclosure' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Who pays for the advice?</h1>
    <div class="prose-hgg mt-6">
      <p><strong>Current status:</strong> HomeGeneratorGuide displays no live affiliate links or advertising. Our guides are free to read, and we do not sell generators or installation leads.</p>
      <h2>Our independence commitment</h2>
      <p>{INDEPENDENCE}</p>
      <p>We never accept payment from generator brands. Manufacturer advertising, sponsored articles, paid placement, paid rankings, and favorable coverage in exchange for money are prohibited.</p>
      <h2>No referral commissions</h2>
      <p>We do not receive generator-brand, dealer, or installer referral fees. We do not sell your contact information to installers or steer your choice toward a company that pays us.</p>
      <h2>Any future funding must meet the same standard</h2>
      <p>If the way this site is funded changes, we will disclose it here and at the point where it matters to readers. It must comply with the existing prohibition on generator-brand, dealer, and installer payments and advertising. Funding cannot buy editorial conclusions.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> about a potential conflict. You deserve to know whose interests an article serves.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
